Hummingbird Symbolism
\b0\fs24 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \

\fs24 It is not commonly known that the fluttering wings of the hummingbird \cb4 move in the pattern of an infinity symbol - further solidifying their symbolism of eternity, continuity, and infinity.\cb3 \
\
By observing the hummingbird, we see they are \cb4 seemingly tireless\cb3 . \cb4 Always actively seeking the sweetest nectar\cb3 , they remind us to forever seek out the good in life and the beauty in each day.\
\cb1 \
\cb3 The prime message of the hummingbird animal totem is: 
\b "The sweetest nectar is within!"
\b0 \cb1 \
\
\cb3 Amazing migrators, some hummingbirds are \cb4 known to wing their way as far as 2000 miles to reach their destination\cb3 . \cb4 This quality reminds us to be persistent in the persuit of our dreams\cb3 , and adopt the tenacity of the hummingbird in our lives.\cb1 \
\cb3 The hummingbird animal totem is a messenger of hope and jubilation.\cb1  \cb3 Hummingbird animal totems offer powerful as well as elegant attributes....\
\
